<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-santomea-turing-wavelength-s0> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila santomea Schnakenberg wavelength at 2.326 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma), pass 1 (Drosophila santomea)",
        "Drosophila santomea Schnakenberg wavelength at 2.326 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma), pass 1 faithfully reproduces Drosophila santomea morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-drosophila-santomea-turing-wavelength-s0-1>,
