        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-drosophila-santomea-turing-wavelength-s0-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-santomea-turing-wavelength-s0.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Drosophila santomea specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is carried by the MorphoEval rubric assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/main/models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-santomea-turing-wavelength-s0.py> ;
