        "reported_in_source: Jeong et al. 2008 show loss of abdominal tan expression in D. santomea.",
        "reported_in_source: Lachaise et al. 2000 described the species; Llopart et al. 2002 mapped the yakuba pigmentation difference.",
        "reported_in_source: Turing 1952 gives k_c from the linearized reaction-diffusion Jacobian.",
        "transfer_boundary: Chronoseries neighbors are scored at this 2.3 µm tier only. Their primordium-slot parameters are not reused." ;
